{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12245070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12245070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1224507001:1":{"text":"이봐! 역시 여기 있었네.","source_cn":"嘿！你果然在这。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB92D5512200B555","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224507002:0":{"text":"할 말 있으면 하고, 없으면 꺼져.","source_cn":"有事快说，没事就滚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EA0322CE1FDF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224507003:1":{"text":"기분 안 좋아? 왜? 바다로 나가지 못해서?","source_cn":"心情不好？为了不能出海的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6617596A13AD64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224507004:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224507005:1":{"text":"사람 참 이상하네. 자기가 거절해놓고 거절당한 것처럼 속상해하고 있잖아.","source_cn":"你这人太奇怪了，明明是你自己拒绝了，却像是被拒绝了一样伤心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4784F9CA55D024D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224507006:1":{"text":"그러게, 나도 날 잘 모르겠어.","source_cn":"是啊，我也搞不懂我自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02139B6B453A5B6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224507007:1":{"text":"봐봐, 이게 뭘까?","source_cn":"瞧瞧，这是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB9A8E9EDA783D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:9::2":{"text":"나침반","source_cn":"罗盘","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BF68A0B410B505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224507008:1":{"text":"네가 바다에서 돌아온 첫날부터 내 눈앞에서 흔들어 보였었잖아.","source_cn":"你从海上回来的第一天就拿着它在我眼前晃过一次了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D115422F804DE22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224507009:1":{"text":"아주 제대로 기억하고 있네. 1등 항해사가 되겠다던 사람이 지금은 왜 이 꼴을 하고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"记得很清楚嘛。那当年是谁说要当我的大副，现在却这个德行？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84BB93054B3F1870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224507010:1":{"text":"다 지나간 일이야. 이젠 바다로 나가고 싶지 않아.","source_cn":"那已经是过去了，我现在不想航海。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8D35322FDD73D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224507011:1":{"text":"...이제 내려놓을 때도 되지 않았어?","source_cn":"……我说，你该放下了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE7BDEDB602D1B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224507012:1":{"text":"테시오는 이미 심판을 받았고, 블러디 로즈도 아버지들의 결백을 증명해 주었잖아.","source_cn":"泰西欧已经受到了审判，血薇帮也证明了老爹他们的清白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E07ED88FA8B3807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224507013:1":{"text":"너랑 우리 아버지가 다시 돌아올 순 없겠지만 자기가 사랑하는 일을 위해 목숨을 바쳤으니... 뭐, 어찌 되었거나 우리 아버지는 불평하지 않았을 거야.","source_cn":"虽然你和我的父亲都不会再回来了，但为自己热爱的事业奉献...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D12D3431F055DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224507014:1":{"text":"바다로 나간 선원이 바다에서 목숨을 잃은 건... 사실 너무 흔한 일이야. 너희 아버지께서 네게 사전에 주의를 주지 않았던 것뿐이겠지.","source_cn":"出航的水手死在海里——这事太常见了，你父亲肯定和你打过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D284EEF02E6A8DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224507015:1":{"text":"넌 아버지가 바다에서 모험을 하다가 목숨을 잃은 것이 아니라 소인배에게 죽임을 당했다는 사실을 받아들이기 힘든 거야.","source_cn":"你只是不能接受他不是死在航海冒险上，而是被一个小人所害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ED0BCA4E53B81E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224507016:1":{"text":"...아니야!","source_cn":"……我没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0E8FD6D656B38C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1224507017:1":{"text":"이봐, 솔직히 말해 봐. 네가 그때 블러디 로즈에 합류한 건 테시오의 증거를 찾기 위해서였지?","source_cn":"喂，你老实说，你当年加入血薇帮是不是为了寻找泰西欧的罪证？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC676B64108311F1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1224507018:1":{"text":"테시오의 공판에 네가 힘을 보태지 않았다고 해도 난 안 믿을 거야.","source_cn":"要说对泰西欧的公审里你没出一点力，我反正不信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95B453EDF152AF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1224507019:1":{"text":"...네 맘대로 생각해.","source_cn":"……随便你怎么说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x981F5B257EF5A669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1224507020:1":{"text":"됐어, 내가 널 모르겠냐?","source_cn":"行了，我还不了解你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2779F82361835A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1224507021:1":{"text":"정신 차려. 그때 네가 너희 아버지를 설득하지 못하고, 내가 우리 아버지를 설득하지 못했던 건... 우리 잘못이 아니라고.","source_cn":"醒一醒吧，当年，你没劝下你父亲，我没劝下我老爹……这都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF203D90169011A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1224507022:1":{"text":"우리가 울면서 말려도 그들은 뿌리쳤을 거야. 그런 다음 함대를 이끌고 테시오에게 가 러스트 항의 보물을 구할 수 있다고 말했겠지.","source_cn":"就算咱们都抱着他们的大腿哭，他们也会甩开，然后带着船队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49429E977C38141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1224507023:0":{"text":"그들은 그런 사람들이야. 너도 알잖아. 파도와 맞서 싸우겠다는 그들의 결심은 누구도 막을 수 없다는 거.","source_cn":"他们就是这样的人，你知道的，没什么能拦下他们一次次迎击...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C800A423C012424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1224507024:1":{"text":"그러니까 이제 내려놓을 때가 되었어, 벨라.","source_cn":"你该放过你自己了，贝拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCACE4DB8A1A73F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1224507025:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1224507026:1":{"text":"왜 또 말이 없어... 어렸을 땐 그렇게 푼수였던 게?","source_cn":"怎么又不说话了……我记得你小时候话挺多的啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70C52C6F034A830E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1224507027:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 한마디 해!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x37328E59047487FF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 한마디 해!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 한마디 해!","variant_male_record_index":"139686","variant_female_record_index":"139687","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1224507027":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 한마디 해!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你也帮忙说两句！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x37328E59047487FF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 한마디 해!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 한마디 해!","variant_male_record_index":"139686","variant_female_record_index":"139687","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1224507028:1":{"text":"바로 그거지!","source_cn":"这话才像样！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x034E34651D9C23B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"바로 그거지!","female":"바로 그거지!","variant_male_record_index":"139688","variant_female_record_index":"139689","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat